  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BIRN Network Hub 2022-2024 - Balkan Investigative Reg Reporting Network (BIRN)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BIRN Network Hub 2022-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For the coming three years, the objectives of BIRN are the following:

IMPACT: The society upholds democratic values and freedoms allowing citizens equal opportunities to make informed choices and hold governments accountable

Outcome Objective 1:

Access to accurate information increased and people in power kept accountable

Outcome Objective 2:

Democratic processes strengthened and public enabled to make informed decisions, demand or influence change

Outcome Objective 3:

Media and CSOs transformed and empowered with skills and knowledge to efectively address public interests

Outcome Objective 4:

BIRN&apos;s journalistic archive and tools used for further examination, advocacy and learning 

Outcome Objective 5:

BIRN grew into a learning and knowledge sharing organisation promoting high-quality journalism production and good governance.

Under each one of the five outcome objective, BIRN has identified &quot;bridging objectives&quot; defining more specifically what should be achieved. As a complement to this overarching framework for planned impact and outcome objectives, BIRN has formulated a results assessment framework where follow up indicators have been identified. Most of the indicators are quantitative. After discussions with Sida during the assessment phase, some more qualitative indicators have been added to the results assessment framework.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till BIRNs regionala arbete - via den regionala hubben - med fokus p&#xe5; unders&#xf6;kande journalistik.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to BIRN&apos;s regional work - through the regional rub - with a focus on investigative journalism.</narrative>
  </description>
